WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.467 --> 00:00:17.468
Sarah: This box will be the perfect stage.

2
00:00:17.469 --> 00:00:21.105
Riley: We're lucky your sister got a new piano!

3
00:00:21.106 --> 00:00:25.633
Theo: Frankie likes to jump on the piano keys.

4
00:00:25.634 --> 00:00:29.577
But Kelli gets mad.

5
00:00:29.578 --> 00:00:33.133
Theo: My dad will make a curtain for the stage.

6
00:00:33.134 --> 00:00:39.670
Theo's Dad: Hi, everyone. I am ready to help.

7
00:00:39.671 --> 00:00:43.239
Riley: It's the perfect day for a pet show.

8
00:00:43.240 --> 00:00:48.824
Ben: The weatherman said it might rain.

9
00:00:48.825 --> 00:00:52.648
Skyler: No way. There's not a cloud in the sky!

10
00:00:52.649 --> 00:00:59.597
Riley: Everyone can sit on the grass.

11
00:00:59.598 --> 00:01:02.637
Theo: Here they come now.

12
00:01:02.638 --> 00:01:05.624
Did you think of a trick for Speedy?

13
00:01:05.625 --> 00:01:10.936
Ben: Not really.

14
00:01:10.937 --> 00:01:19.579
Riley: Hi! Welcome to the Pet Lovers Club's first pet show!

15
00:01:19.580 --> 00:01:21.916
Ben: This is my turtle, Speedy.

16
00:01:21.917 --> 00:01:25.049
He can sit still for hours.

17
00:01:25.050 --> 00:01:28.514
Kids: That's not a trick!

18
00:01:28.515 --> 00:01:36.075
What's next?

19
00:01:36.076 --> 00:01:41.358
Theo: Now Frankie, my frog, will jump through a hoop.

20
00:01:41.359 --> 00:01:47.567
Frankie: Ribbit, ribbit!

21
00:01:47.568 --> 00:01:56.253
Kids: Yay! Hooray!

22
00:01:56.254 --> 00:01:59.931
Skyler: Next Chatter will tell a story.

23
00:01:59.932 --> 00:02:03.602
Chatter: Once upon a time! The end!

24
00:02:03.603 --> 00:02:08.137
Skyler: Chatter, you forgot the middle of the story!

25
00:02:08.138 --> 00:02:10.677
Chatter: Do your homework!

26
00:02:10.678 --> 00:02:15.552
Take out the garbage!

27
00:02:15.553 --> 00:02:19.431
Sarah: Now my cat Mittens will do flips in the air.

28
00:02:19.432 --> 00:02:31.147
And I will catch her!

29
00:02:31.148 --> 00:02:36.771
Theo: And now for the last trick.

30
00:02:36.772 --> 00:02:41.479
Riley: Snooks will find the hidden bone.

31
00:02:41.480 --> 00:02:57.234
Snooks, search!

32
00:02:57.235 --> 00:03:03.916
Theo: It's getting dark.

33
00:03:03.917 --> 00:03:06.310
And I hear thunder!

34
00:03:06.311 --> 00:03:08.747
Skyler: Here comes the rain.

35
00:03:08.748 --> 00:03:14.826
Sarah: And the wind.

36
00:03:14.827 --> 00:03:19.058
Riley: Snooks, come back! Oh no.

37
00:03:19.059 --> 00:03:25.159
Snooks is afraid of thunder!
